        "# Lambda\n",
        "\n",
        "A lambda expression creates an anonymous function from a single expression. For example, `lambda x: x + 1` returns a function that adds one to its argument.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-lambda)"
      ]
    }
